      "text": "TypeScript is a programming language developed and\nmaintained by Microsoft. \nIt is a strict syntactical superset of JavaScript and\nadds optional static typing to the language.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TypeScript is a programming language developed and maintained by Microsoft. \nIt is a strict syntactical superset of JavaScript and adds optional static typing to the language.",
